# Optional CA bundle (leave as-is to use the built-in ESP-IDF certificate bundle).
#
# This file is intentionally NOT a certificate: when its first character is not
# '-' the esp-mqtt adapter falls back to esp_crt_bundle_attach(), which already
# trusts the DigiCert/Microsoft roots that Azure IoT Hub and DPS present. Paste a
# "-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----" block here only if you want to pin a specific CA.
